  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Fear of Gosh\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fear-of-gosh.png\" title=\"Image:Fear-of-gosh.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Fear-of-gosh.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fear-of-gosh.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fighter\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Unknown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Causes enemy to flee, does Divine damage\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Your melee weapon becomes blessed by Gosh Almighty causing Divine Damage to your target and possibly several other nearby enemies.  Each enemy that takes damage my also be stricken with the Fear of Gosh, causing them to flee.\n<br/>\nThis skill requires a melee weapon.\n</p><p><b>Cool down:</b> 5 Seconds\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Causes X Divine Damage over Y Seconds.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 14\n</td><td> 35\n</td><td> 56\n</td><td> 77\n</td><td> 98\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X *\n</td><td style=\"font-size:90%\"> 48-90\n</td><td style=\"font-size:90%\"> 146.25-273.75\n</td><td style=\"font-size:90%\"> 339-633\n</td><td style=\"font-size:90%\"> 485-905\n</td><td style=\"font-size:90%\"> 630-1176\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td> 3\n</td><td> 3.75\n</td><td> 4.5\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> 6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 33.8\n</td><td> 65.7\n</td><td> 97.6\n</td><td> 129.4\n</td><td> 161.3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 15590\n</td><td> 38976\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
